" end="01:09.560">wax </span><span begin="01:09.560" end="01:09.830">right </span><span begin="01:09.830" end="01:10.010">now</span><span begin="01:10.010" end="01:10.010">, </span><span begin="01:10.010" end="01:10.070">yeah </span><span begin="01:10.070" end="01:10.070">（</span><span begin="01:10.070" end="01:10.160">Right </span><span begin="01:10.160" end="01:10.310">now</span><span begin="01:10.310" end="01:10.370">）</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:10.370" end="01:13.700"><span begin="01:10.370" end="01:10.610">She </span><span begin="01:10.610" end="01:10.850">want </span><span begin="01:10.850" end="01:10.940">all </span><span begin="01:10.940" end="01:11.120">the </span><span begin="01:11.120" end="01:11.420">eggs </span><span begin="01:11.420" end="01:11.510">in </span><span begin="01:11.510" end="01:11.810">one </span><span begin="01:11.810" end="01:12.140">batch </span><span begin="01:12.140" end="01:12.440">right </span><span begin="01:12.440" end="01:12.500">now</span><span begin="01:12.500" end="01:12.500">, </span><span begin="01:12.500" end="01:12.590">but </span><span begin="01:12.590" end="01:12.590">（</span><span begin="01:12.590" end="01:12.680">Right</span><span begin="01:12.680" end="01:12.680">, </span><span begin="01:12.680" end="01:13.100">right </span><span begin="01:13.100" end="01:13.430">now</span><span begin="01:13.430" end="01:13.700">）</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:13.700" end="01:15.560"><span begin="01:13.700" end="01:13.850">I </span><span begin="01:13.850" end="01:14.090">can't </span><span begin="01:14.090" end="01:14.420">risk </span><span begin="01:14.420" end="01:14.720">that </span><span begin="01:14.720" end="01:15.050">right </span><span begin="01:15.050" end="01:15.350">now</span><span begin="01:15.350" end="01:15.350">, </span><span begin="01:15.350" end="01:15.560">no</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:15.620" end="01:18.380"><span begin="01:15.620" end="01:16.070">City </span><span begin="01:16.070" end